{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05408","headline":"三日岐王宅 · 张谔","name":"三日岐王宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉女贵妃生，嫛婗始发声。\n金盆浴未了，綳子绣初成。\n翡翠雕芳缛，真珠帖小缨。\n何时学健步？鬬取落花轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}